        "shape": "cushion",
        "tone": "#f06aa0"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It was the Argyle mine, in Western Australia's Kimberley region.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "mine",
        "name": "Argyle mine",
        "role": "Kimberley, Western Australia",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "coat",
            "outfitColor": "#c9792f",
            "hair": "short",
            "hairColor": "#3a2a1e",
            "skin": "#d9a77a",
            "expression": "smile",
            "hat": "cap"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mining began there in 1983.",
      "say": "Mining began there in nineteen eighty-three.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "1983",
        "sub": "Mining begins"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Argyle gave the world more than 90 percent of its pinks.",
      "say": "Argyle gave the world more than ninety percent of its pinks.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Over 90%",
        "sub": "Of the world's pink diamonds"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "By weight, under a tenth of a percent was pink.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "reveal",
        "item": "gem",
        "shape": "round",
        "tone": "#f06aa0",
        "label": "Under 0.1%, by weight"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Scientists link the pink to a bend in the crystal structure.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "A bent crystal",
        "sub": "Linked to the pink"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Each year, an invitation only tender offered around sixty stones.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "study",
        "name": "The yearly tender",
        "role": "About sixty stones",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "suit",
            "outfitColor": "#3a4a5e",
            "hair": "slick",
            "hairColor": "#2a1e18",
            "skin": "#efc9a6",
            "expression": "smile"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The 2017 tender offered the Argyle Everglow, a red diamond.",
      "say": "The twenty seventeen tender offered the Argyle Everglow, a red diamond.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "reveal",
        "item": "gem",
        "shape": "cushion",
        "tone": "#d8243c",
        "label": "Argyle Everglow, 2.11 carats"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Argyle Pink Jubilee was cut to about eight carats.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Pink Jubilee",
        "sub": "Cut to about 8 carats"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It was donated to Museums Victoria in Australia.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "study",
        "name": "Museums Victoria",
        "role": "Home of the Pink Jubilee",
        "cast": [
          {
